 <div class="box"><h2>01 · Free-space threshold</h2><p>Below this amount of free cache space, the script attempts to start the built-in Mover.</p><label for="ms-threshold">Threshold (GiB)</label><br><input id="ms-threshold" name="KUSZOB_GIB" type="number" min="1" max="<?=$msMax?>" required value="<?=$msValues['KUSZOB_GIB']?>"><input id="ms-slider" aria-label="Free-space threshold slider" type="range" min="1" max="<?=$msMax?>" value="<?=$msValues['KUSZOB_GIB']?>"><small>Higher value: may start sooner. Lower value: files stay in cache longer.</small></div>
 <div class="box"><h2>02 · Retry interval</h2><p>Minimum time between two start attempts.</p><label for="ms-cooldown">Wait (minutes)</label><br><input id="ms-cooldown" name="UJRA_PROBALKOZAS_MP" type="number" min="1" max="10080" required value="<?=$msValues['UJRA_PROBALKOZAS_MP']?>"><p id="ms-hours"></p><small>The script check schedule separately determines when the next attempt occurs.</small></div>
